        },
        "block_02": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Dr.Strips+ Sleep?",
            "answer": "<p>A sleep-focused supplement in a thin oral strip. It dissolves on your tongue and carries pistachio-derived phytomelatonin, GABA, valerian root, passion flower and chamomile toward your bloodstream — skipping the gut and the liver.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_03": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I use it?",
            "answer": "<p>Place one strip on your tongue about ten minutes before bed and let it dissolve. No water, no chewing — just continue your evening as usual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_04": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need water?",
            "answer": "<p>No. The strip is designed to dissolve on its own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_05": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When should I take it?",
            "answer": "<p>About ten minutes before you intend to sleep, as part of the wind-down you already do.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_06": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take it every night?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The formula is calibrated for nightly use, with no dependency mechanism and no need to increase the dose over time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_07": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it suitable for everyone?",
            "answer": "<p>Supplements are not appropriate for everyone. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, taking medication, managing a health condition, or unsure whether this product is right for you, speak to a doctor before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_08": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it make me fall asleep immediately?",
            "answer": "<p>We don't position it as an instant fix. Sleep is shaped by many things — routine, environment, stress, light exposure and individual biology. Our aim is a thoughtfully formulated strip that supports a broader sleep routine, not a switch you flip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_09": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it a medicine?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Dr.Strips+ Sleep is a food supplement and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_10": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where is it made?",
            "answer": "<p>In a GMP, HACCP and ISO 22000-certified facility in Singapore.</p>"
          }
        }
